An airframe company that's pioneering the commercial flight industry. Run by a fortune dragon, Hildebrandt.

The company was first to market with commercial airlines and has kept that market, so that any other company wanting a commercial line buys Hildebrandt's airplanes. Along with [[Org/General Thematics/index|General Thematics]] it is pulling back from the contracts it holds with [[Org/Belvedere|Belvedere]] and the Qureshi family, saying only that it means to focus its energies elsewhere. The Qureshi barristers have time to lean on only one of the two.
